Kitchen Stove, Kitchen Cabinet, Kitchen Cabinet Drawer, Kitchen Bar (serving
counter). Via https://poly.pizza (model pages credit "Kenney", CC0).

## Quaternius — https://quaternius.com (CC0, public domain)
Kitchen Sink, Kitchen Fridge, Small Table, Round Table, Chair, Burger, Pizza.
