## Procedural (built in code, matching low-poly style)
Player + guest characters (capsule/sphere chibi with 4 hairstyles, tintable
skin/hair/shirt), curry / noodle / tea / soup / salad / cake dishes, room,
plants, shelves, room doors, order bubbles, floor/wall canvas textures.

Thank you to all the artists who share their work freely.
